Python 3.11+. snake_case. Type hints on public functions. One-line docstring per function.
No custom crypto: hashlib SHA-256 and the cryptography package Ed25519 only.
Canonical JSON for anything hashed or signed: sorted keys, separators (",", ":"), ensure_ascii=False, UTF-8.
Never edit CONTRACT.md without the change protocol. Never edit another person's folder.
Base model only. Do not add anything listed under Out of Scope in AGENTS.md.
Do not commit keys, databases, spool files or real data.
